%のサトウキビ由来のプラスチックの合計82%が再生可能資源からできた容器を使用しています！　3月4日から販売開始しています\\( ¨̮ )/　https://event.rakuten.co.jp/drink/justwater/　詳しくはぜひこちらから見てください(^^)　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHM056KWB9SCA69YSNY4Z28","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　　写真集撮影の沖縄行ったとき最終日でお買い物してた時の写真🌴🍍"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHM06D70VTPBD1B0CZVF0W4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHM07C9GK2QATR68EKZ91H3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n懐かしい〜🍦　齊藤京子"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-keya-33987":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんはっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"梅干しが美味しいなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただただ梅干しが美味しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃は梅干しを食べ過ぎて止められたくらい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は塩分とか気にしちゃうけれど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は夏前なので1日1個は食べているよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほうれん草の梅かつお和えが今日のヒット。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気になる梅好きさんは調べてみてね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日ははやっと質問回答動画の編集を終えたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3日間もかかった。かかりすぎ。がんばれ私🐷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部で計16分だったの…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので、昨日から2つずつ送ることにしたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/1d3/20ea7bf3aee3739